title: "Wasstraat Archeologische Data"
abstract: "Open-source platform that collects, cleans, links and makes searchable the archaeological data of Dutch municipalities: an Apache Airflow ETL pipeline and a Flask web application, first developed for Archeologie Delft (Municipality of Delft) and generalised for other municipalities with funding from the Innovatiefonds Nederlandse Archeologie (Stichting Reuvens)."
